        "Enter The Eldieme Necropolis from the (Batallia Downs I-10) entrance in Batallia Downs.",
        "You can find Liches on the first level as you travel around although spawns are sparse.",
        "This same area is where the ???s for the key items spawn, so if you go there, you're better off clicking those instead. You must get all three key items to use this key item.",
        "Hume Bones camp in The Eldieme Necropolis",
        "Enter from the (Batallia Downs I-10) entrance in Batallia Downs.",
        "You will need 2 or more members of the party to control the plates that open doors.",
        "At the first intersection at (The Eldieme Necropolis J-8), go South. Head to the gate room at (The Eldieme Necropolis H-9). You need to go through Odin's Gate (facing west), then continue North to (The Eldieme Necropolis G-8). Someone must then flip a switch to open Shiva's Gate. Immediately on the right after you pass through Shiva's Gate is a switch that you can trigger to let the rest of your party through.",
        "Once through the gate, head North to the center of the room at (The Eldieme Necropolis G-8) and fall down hole marked A.",
        "When you land, head east and you'll quickly reach Hume Bones area. There are 2 to 4 Liches available for pulling. Warning: Elemental danger. If you don't want to aggro elementals, you may camp in the large staircase between the Ka room and Lich room, but you will have to pull the Fallen Knights or pet-pull the Liches under the effect of sneak.",
