        "(Xarcabard I-6) Boreal Tiger. The reward is a Round Frigicite.",
        "(Xarcabard J-6) Boreal Coeurl. The reward is a Square Frigicite.",
        "(Xarcabard G-10) Boreal Hound. The reward is a Triangular Frigicite",
