        "If you have never defeated Maat on any job, you do not lose Experience Points in this fight upon death. This includes jobs which have unique limit breaks outside of Maat. However, after you have managed to win at least once, Experience Points are lost upon defeat in subsequent fights, even on different Jobs.",
